  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Chu kì của sóng là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>π</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (giây).</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra chiều cao của sóng là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cm).</li></ol>",
